WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.767
It's over.

2
00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.533
It's over, and it's fine.

3
00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:08.533
(It's not.)

4
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:11.767
It's over, and it's

5
00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:15.067
fine.

6
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:20.067
(It's not.)

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.633
It's fine.

8
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:28.633
Lukewarm summer, loose and slow

9
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:30.567
Bicycle sound, pedal, key, and go

10
00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:32.233
Passed your corner, didn't turn, went long

11
00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:34.267
Long way, long way, longer than I thought

12
00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.467
I'm okay, I'm okay, I'm—

13
00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:37.133
(ちがう)

14
00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.567
Should've said it

15
00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:39.500
Said it, lost it

16
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.533
Didn't say it, lost it

17
00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:42.067
Lost it, lost it, lost it

18
00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:42.967
It's over!

19
00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:44.233
It's over. Can't say it

20
00:00:44.233 --> 00:00:46.100
Say it, say it, say it late

21
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:46.967
It's over!

22
00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:48.133
Fading out

23
00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.833
Faster, faster—faster than light

24
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:51.433
Forget me, forget me,

25
00:00:51.433 --> 00:00:56.433
—but it still hurts, so it was real

26
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:01.700
(本当だった)

27
00:01:11.533 --> 00:01:15.067
Strange station, strange gate, strange voice

28
00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:17.133
But the summer smells the same

29
00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:19.700
Same heat, same everything

30
00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.633
Everything but you

31
00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:22.467
それだけ。

32
00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:24.500
I don't believe in

33
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.800
"Maybe, maybe in another life"

34
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.200
but one more

35
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:28.667
time,

36
00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:30.067
let me turn that corner

37
00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.600
(Turn it, turned it, turned away)

38
00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.400
It's over!

39
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.800
It's over. Can't say it

40
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.500
Say it, say it, say it late

41
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.600
It's over, fading out

42
00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.233
Faster, faster—faster than light

43
00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:41.000
Forget me, forget me,

44
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.267
—but it still hurts, so it was real

45
00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:49.267
(だから、いい)

46
00:02:01.967 --> 00:02:06.967
Again

47
00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:17.600
It's over.

48
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.500
It's over.

49
00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.233
(Over.)

50
00:02:21.233 --> 00:02:23.800
It's over.

51
00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:28.800
It's over.

52
00:02:31.967 --> 00:02:34.167
And it's fine!
